cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the article and the software archive."
title: "GMGTS Matlab code package"
abstract: >-
  MATLAB code package for nonlinear mixed-effects inference of ODE-based
  models using Gradient Matching Global Two-Stage (GMGTS), including a
  Global Two-Stage (GTS) implementation, a data generator, an interactive
  smoothing app, and scripts and data reproducing the accompanying article.
